-#: Intensity acceptance is a statistical claim about a thinned Poisson
-#: process, so its resolution is declared BEFORE any measurement:
-#:   * the declaration is checked against the rate it would produce if the
-#:     burst transform were silently NOT applied (multiplier 1);
-#:   * the test is only DECIDABLE when the two expected counts are separated
-#:     by more than INTENSITY_SIGMA standard deviations of each
